  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あそこにいるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, there he is.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんか、怒ってるシ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He seems kind of angry...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271940</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おい、タンス野郎！
勝手にうろつくなよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, closet freak! Knock
it off with the prowling!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だーめだー！
この村、陰気臭過ぎて、
おらには合わんだーよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can't help it! There's a gloom
over this town I just can't stand!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この淀んだ空気、
どうにか解消してほしいだー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even the air's got a stagnant taste
to it! Someone's gotta do something
to fix it, one way or another!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だからって、
手でバタバタしなくても
いいかラ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Okay, but...do you really need
to flail your arms so much...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うるせー、エト助！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shut your hole, Ethos!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おらに講釈たれるなんて、
里芋と同じぐれぇ
滑ってるだーよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Going to try and lecture me?
All I hear is ya sputtering
like a drowned cat!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272332</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>里芋って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...A drowned cat...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おら、決めただ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I've decided.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>決めたって……、
何をですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Um...decided what?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村のヤツらひとりひとり
ビンタ喰らわして、
目を覚まさせてやるだーよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm gonna give everyone in this
village a firm slap to bring 'em
to their senses, one by one!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272648</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>び、ビンタって、
おまえ、勝手に、
そんなことしたら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, you're gonna
slap them? Uh,
but if you do that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うーるーせー！
おらに指図するんでねぇ！！
こーの、毛無しのハゲぼうずが！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'M TELLING YA TO SHUT IT! Ya can't up and
tell me what to do! Even if it *did* rain here,
you wouldn't feel it dropping, ya numbskull!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>it's a hypothetical, so I changed couldn't to wouldn't. -dragon</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まんずは、あそこに見える、
クソガキどもを
血祭りにあげてやるだーよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then I'll start with those kids
over there! Gotta teach'em
a lesson they won't forget!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おらおらおらおらーーーー！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>ORA ORA ORA ORA!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょ、ちょ、ちょっと！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W-W-Wait!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>早く、止めに行かなきゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come on, we have to stop him!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
